msgid "Servo Shield"
msgstr "Servo Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/servo-shield-old.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Servo Shield drives up to eight hobby servos in parallel from the OpenMV"
" Cam over I2C, using a PCA9685 servo / PWM controller."
msgstr ""
"Servo Shield driver upp till åtta hobbyservon parallellt från OpenMV Cam "
"över I2C, med hjälp av en PCA9685 servo-/PWM-styrkrets."

